&lt;p&gt;This is maybe the most complex question that is never asked in the interview process in tech.
And often not even on a managerial level.
But: it is such an interesting one to discuss!
There might be no right or wrong.
But it does reveal a lot about people&amp;rsquo;s thought processes and mental models they have collected.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>